<title>LATVIA: Latvian Dec 1996 inflation 13.1 pct, mo/mo 0.6.</title>
<headline>Latvian Dec 1996 inflation 13.1 pct, mo/mo 0.6.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inflation in Latvia in December was 0.6 percent month-on-month and 13.1 percent year on year, the statistics committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> LATVIAN CONSUMER PRICES	Dec '96    Nov '96    Dec '95</p>
<p> Month-on-month change (pct)    +0.6	 +0.8	 +1.7</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (pct)     +13.1	+14.4	+23.1</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
